# Files that must never reach the runtime container.
#
# zerops.yaml deploys `api/~`, which is the whole api directory. Without this
# list, a local `zcli push` would ship:
#   - api/.env      real credentials, and it would SHADOW the platform's
#                   injected environment because main.py loads it at import
#   - api/venv      a macOS-built virtualenv landing in a Linux container,
#                   ahead of the vendored deps on PYTHONPATH
# Both are silent failures rather than loud ones, which is why they are listed
# here as well as in .gitignore — .gitignore only governs what reaches GitHub,
# and `zcli push` uploads from disk.

/api/.env
/api/.env.*
/api/venv
/api/__pycache__
*.pyc

/web/node_modules
/web/dist

/neo4j-data
/neo4j-logs
.DS_Store
